## Architecture

```
cocapn_health/
├── src/cocapn_health/
│   ├── __init__.py         # HealthChecker, ServiceDef, CheckResult, FLEET_SERVICES,
│   │                       # check_http, check_tcp, check_dns, check_process,
│   │                       # check_disk, check_memory, check_cpu, check_system
│   ├── cli.py              # argparse CLI
│   ├── api.py              # REST API server + HealthCache
│   └── sunset_bridge.py    # EventBusHealthChecker + thermal snapshots
└── tests/
    ├── test_health.py
    ├── test_api.py
    ├── test_cli.py
    └── test_system_checks.py
```

